 planet. Explore with 1–4 friends, heal the bosses (yes, heal), and open the gate home before Mother Narcalid slams it. You also sit down and meditate. I used to haul space garbage. This is a promotion, I think.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341110/header.jpg?t=1787865752", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787865752", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787865752", "website": "http://lotus-mountain.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5  @ 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon and Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Lotus Mountain Creative"], "publishers": ["Lotus Mountain Creative"], "demos": [{"appid": 2790620, "descriptio